              at 1 min. DBM mice with overnight fasted plasma glucose levels of
              less than ISO mg/100 ml similarly showed elevated basal IRI levels
              and a rapid initial release. DBM animals with higher fasted plasma
              glucose levels however had an impaired secretory respon...",
