  journal  = "Ann. Trop. Med. Public Health",
  abstract = "Background: Rodents are the main reservoir hosts of zoonotic
              cutaneous leishmaniases (ZCLs) in different parts of Iran.
              Nonetheless, no evidence of natural infestation of Leishmania
              parasite has been reported from spiny mice Acomys dimidiatus
              (Rodentia: Muridae). Materials and Methods: Between March 2011 and
              March 2012, 62 wild rodents were captured and checked for
              leishmanial infestation of their livers and spleens using
