              Fars province, southern Iran. Results: Overall, 62 rodents
              consisting of 42 Tatera indica, 6 Meriones libycus, 5 Meriones
              persicus, 5 Mus musculus, and 4 A. dimidiatus were identified.
              Infestation to Leishmania major was confirmed in all the captured
              species of rodents: T. indica (23.8\%), M. libycus (50\%), A.
              dimidiatus (50\%), M. persicus (20\%), and M. musculus (20\%).
              Conclusions:T. indica was the reservoir host of L. major in this
              focus of ZCL. Moreover, M. libycus and M. persicus had a
