              ml/24 h, fecal output g/24 h, size of fecal droplet, hair length,
              life span, length of oestrus cycle, duration of pregnancy,
              building nest, litter size, stage of musculoskeletal maturity at
              birth, and the duration of weaning. Characteristics were obtained
              by searching SCOPUS as well as the World Wide Web with key words
