  journal  = "Genes Cell.",
  abstract = "The article presents data on the regeneration of the auricle
              tissues of Acomys cahirinus mice (n=12) and Balb/c mice (n=12).
              Two experimental models were used: a full-thickness perforated
              defect with a diameter of 3 mm and subtotal removal of the
