              directly related to muscle development or function. Our RT-qPCR
              data reveals induction of the myogenic regulatory factors, as well
              as upregulation of embryonic myosin, starting between days 14 and
              18 post-wounding in A. cahirinus. In contrast, the myogenic
              regulatory factors remain downregulated, embryonic myosin is only
              modestly upregulated, and no new muscle fibers of the panniculus
