              differential expression of the upstream regulators Wnt7a, Wnt2 and
              Wnt6 during wound healing. Our analyses demonstrate that A.
              cahirinus is capable of de novo skeletal muscle regeneration of
              the panniculus carnosus following removal of the extracellular
