              observations suggest that adult Acomys displays remarkable cardiac
              recovery properties after acute coronary artery occlusion and may
              be a useful model to understand functional recovery better.
              TRANSLATIONAL PERSPECTIVE: Adult Acomys provides a novel mammalian
