  number   =  2,
  pages    = "308--322",
  abstract = "STUDY QUESTION: Does the newly discovered menstruating spiny mouse
              exhibit behavioural and metabolic changes in correlation with
              premenstrual phases of the menstrual cycle? SUMMARY ANSWER: This
              is the first report of cycle variability in the exploratory and
