  volume   =  38,
  number   =  4,
  pages    = "913--916",
  abstract = "Male spiny mice (Acomys cahirinus) were challenged with several
              putative dipsogenic stimulus conditions: hypertonic sodium
              chloride (NaCL), 24-h water deprivation, d,l-isoproterenol HCl,
              angiotensin II (AII) and polythylene glycol (PEG), or control
